// Original NPC library: weapons back on (companion to peace-zone.gs1)
// Category: combat / weapons (zones)
// Image: none (invisible)
// Events: playerenters
//
// Put one in every level a player can reach straight from a peace zone:
// the levels its links and warps lead to, and wherever players start after
// dying. A zone can only switch weapons back on while the player is still
// in its level, so without this a player who leaves from inside the zone
// keeps weapons off, and the server saves that to the account (lab run,
// 2026-11-04: an enableweapons on entry turns them back on).

if (playerenters) {
  hide;
  enableweapons;
}
